<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
    <title>Maintenance | Oxymaux</title>
    <style>
        :root { color-scheme: light; font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif; }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 2rem; color: #24343b; background: #eaf5f8; }
        main { width: min(100%, 38rem); padding: 3rem 2rem; text-align: center; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .88); border: 1px solid #c8e1e8; border-radius: 1rem; box-shadow: 0 1.5rem 4rem rgba(46, 91, 105, .14); }
        img { width: 5.5rem; height: 5.5rem; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 50%; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
        h1 { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3rem); font-weight: 600; }
        p { margin: .75rem 0; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.6; }
        .note { color: #52717b; font-size: .95rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <img src="/images/logo.jpeg" alt="Oxymaux">
        <h1>Site en maintenance</h1>
        <p>Le site est momentanément indisponible afin d'effectuer une maintenance.</p>
        <p class="note">Nous revenons très bientôt. Merci de votre patience.</p>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
